OL,3,GNEWSAAberdeen flat fire treated as
OL,4,Adeliberate
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire that forced a number of flats in
OL,7,FAberdeen to be evacuated is being
OL,8,Ftreated as deliberate.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FRichmond Walk, in the Rosemount area,
OL,12,Fjust after 20:20 on Monday.
OL,14,FOne person received treatment at the
OL,15,Fscene for the effects of smoke
OL,16,Finhalation.
OL,18,FPolice Scotland said the fire was being
OL,19,Ftreated as wilful.
